{"id":8867095118023,"title":"Owl Patchwork Pattern Quilt Set, Animals Quilt Set Style, Owl Nights","handle":"owl-patchwork-pattern-quilt-set-animals-quilt-set-style-owl-nights","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace rustic elegance and a touch of countryside charm with this beautiful Quilt Set from Jeminise. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, it’s perfect for adding warmth and tradition to any bedroom, making it an ideal personalized gift for your loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Farmhouse Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features charming classic patterns for a cozy, timeless look in your bedroom.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift Idea:\u003c\/strong\u003e A perfect present for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size, adding pillowcases, or including a name.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86''), Full (80\"x90''), Queen (90\"x90''), and King (102\"x91\").\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat for quick drying and fluffiness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e This set includes 1 quilt, with the option to add 2 pillowcases for a complete look.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eMaterial Details:\u003c\/strong\u003e Crafted from durable and soft Polycotton fabric for comfortable use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e